    "A 10%% fee will be deducted from the offered amount (%@). You'll actually receive %@." : {
      "comment" : "Confirmation alert message for the 10% platform fee. The first argument is the gross amount (proposed budget or task budget). The second argument is the net amount (after 10% fee).",
